537
00:59:44,042 --> 00:59:47,542
A woman should be scared of exposing herself more than anything else .

538
00:59:47,584 --> 00:59:49,209
So , be ashamed .

539
00:59:49,251 --> 00:59:53,167
These are not the old times . We have values now .

540
00:59:53,209 --> 00:59:59,459
Our men are becoming martyrs to protect these values ...

541
01:02:19,542 --> 01:02:21,292
