Mum , please help me !

684
01:17:18,542 --> 01:17:19,917
Mum !

685
01:17:19,958 --> 01:17:23,208
Mum , please help me !

686
01:17:35,833 --> 01:17:38,041
Mum !

687
01:17:41,751 --> 01:17:43,167
Dorsa !

